pidload (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add gettext catalogs for L1 locales (ar, de, en, es_MX, fr, it, ja, ko,
    zh_CN) and mark UI/CLI strings for translation.
  * Add whole-document man page translations under man/<locale>/.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:50:00 +0800

pidload (0.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: wxWidgets process and traffic monitor.
  * Chart process CPU/I/O, block-device and network traffic; session history
    in memory with -w as the default visible span.
  * Add -d/-i/-a/-c/-m/-T/-F/-C/-t/-w/-o CLI; record per-interval logs under
    --output as <name>.<pid>.log (and related counter logs).
  * Build with C++17 and libwxgtk3.2; AUI dockable charts and menus.
  * Match NAME as pid/exe/path/window title/globs; per-process line styles.
  * Sync pan (drag) and zoom (wheel) across charts; time X-axis labels.
  * Display Curve styles (Segment / Quadratic / Bicubic); network Display Unit
    (raw size / payload size / packets) via context menu.
  * Menu icons and keyboard shortcuts for common actions.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:50:00 +0800
